{"$comment":"Media slots for the demo. Replace `src` with a real asset path (place the file in /public and point src at it, e.g. \"/media/hero.mp4\"). While `src` is null the placeholder is shown. Keep the exact dimensions for a pixel-perfect swap.","hero":{"type":"video","width":1920,"height":1080,"aspect":"16:9","placeholder":"/placeholders/hero-1920x1080.svg","src":null,"note":"Homepage hero background video (mp4, 1920x1080). null -> poster placeholder."},"categoryTile":{"type":"image","width":800,"height":1000,"aspect":"4:5","placeholder":"/placeholders/category-800x1000.svg","src":null,"note":"Tile image in the 'shop by category' row."},"productCard":{"type":"image","width":1000,"height":1000,"aspect":"1:1","placeholder":"/placeholders/product-1000x1000.svg","src":null,"note":"Square product image used in carousels and the catalog grid."},"productGallery":{"type":"image","width":1600,"height":1200,"aspect":"4:3","placeholder":"/placeholders/gallery-1600x1200.svg","src":null,"note":"Product detail gallery frames."},"lifestyle":{"type":"image","width":1600,"height":900,"aspect":"16:9","placeholder":"/placeholders/lifestyle-1600x900.svg","src":null,"note":"Lifestyle banner blocks."},"logo":{"type":"image","width":696,"height":221,"aspect":"3.15:1","placeholder":"/placeholders/logo-200x40.svg","src":"/sportliner-logo.png","note":"Brand logo in header/footer. SPORT LINER wordmark, cropped from public/sportliner-logo.jpg; the black background is part of the artwork."}}